  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Skatteverket designst&#xf6;d 2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish Tax Authority design support 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med denna insats &#xe4;r att Skatteverket, i dialog med Sida och utlandsmyndigheter, myndigheter i partnerl&#xe4;nder samt andra samarbetspartners, ska identifiera behov av kapacitetsutveckling inom skatteomr&#xe5;det. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att skapa f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r en v&#xe4;l underbyggd strategisk kapacitetsutvecklingsinsats &#xe5;ren 2026-2028 d&#xe4;r Skatteverket kan arbeta flexibelt och effektivt med kapacitetsbyggande insatser som ett komplement till de bilaterala insatser som finansieras av utlandsmyndigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this contribution is for the Swedish Tax Agency, in dialogue with Sida and foreign missions, authorities in partner countries and other partners, to identify capacity development needs in the tax collection area. The goal is to create the conditions for a well-founded strategic capacity development intervention in the years 2026-2028 where the Swedish Tax Agency can work flexibly and effectively with capacity building activities as a complement to the bilateral contributions financed by foreign missions.</narrative>
  </description>
